      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0000"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C002",
      "text": "A command line application is an application that can run from the command line.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0001", "Q0002"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C003",
      "text": "A command line application does not have a graphical user interface.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0003", "Q0004"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C004",
      "text": "Building a graphical user interface application is very complicated, so we start with command line applications.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0008"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C005",
      "text": "Give the project a name, e.g., hello world.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0013"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C006",
      "text": "The project location is shown in the IDE, e.g., inside the idea projects folder.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0014", "Q0015"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C007",
      "text": "The base package is set to com.codewithmosh.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
      "literal_kind": "verbal",
      "instructional_role": null,
      "refs": ["Q0016"],
      "related_refs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C008",
      "text": "On another machine the base package may be com.package.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
